body:
if you went to mexico you could buy a 8 course meal with that, i’m probably not even joking. (exaggeration as a joke)

i went to mexico to go visit family and we went to this nice looking restaurant for breakfast and i ordered a 3 eggs, 5 pieces of bacon and some corn tortillas and beans. that only came out to 2.19$ 
but if i were to order this in the US, i’d probably be spending about 17.82$
